  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "Thank you for calling VeloFit. Your call may be recorded for quality assurance. Please hold for the next available agent.",
      "speakerId": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "role": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768940592000000
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. My name is Charlie. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768940600266666
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return something.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 82670,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768940604999999
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly look into that for you. To get started, could I have your name and order number?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768940606999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Alex Chen. Order is 987-554.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 82670,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768940613599999
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you, Alex. I see the order here for the VeloPro cycling shoes. What specifically is the issue with them? Is it a technical fault or more of a preference issue?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768940615666665
    },
    {
      "text": "They give me blisters. I'd call that a fault.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 82670,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768940626866665
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm very sorry to hear that. That's definitely not the experience we want for our customers. Sometimes, the placement of the cleats can affect pressure points. Have you had a chance to adjust them at all?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768940630066665
    },
    {
      "text": "I shouldn't have to be a bike mechanic to wear a pair of shoes. I just want a refund.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 82670,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768940643866665
    },
    {
      "text": "I understand completely. Let me just check the purchase date for you. I see they were delivered 37 days ago. One moment while I confirm the return eligibility.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768940649733331
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 82670,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768940660533331
    },
    {
      "text": "Alright, thank you for your patience. I've confirmed that these cycling shoes fall under our standard 10-day return policy. So yes, we can absolutely process this return for you for a full refund.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768940661233331
    },
    {
      "text": "Whatever. Just send the label.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 82670,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768940674499997
    },
    {
      "text": "Of course. I have just processed the return authorization. You'll receive an email with a pre-paid shipping label within the next few minutes. Once we receive the item back at our warehouse, your refund will be processed.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768940676699997
    },
    {
      "text": "Great. Anything else I need to do?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 82670,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768940691633330
    },
    {
      "text": "Nope, just printing the label and dropping the package off is all. Is there anything else I can assist you with today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768940694099996
    },
    {
      "text": "No.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 82670,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768940702166662
    },
    {
